OL,3,GNEWSADozens 'ripped off' in #500,000
OL,4,Abuilding 'scam'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSCC's director strongly denied he had
OL,7,Fdeliberately scammed customers saying
OL,8,Fhe did not take customers' money
OL,9,Fwithout intending to carry out the work
OL,10,Fand that he was "deeply sorry" to all
OL,11,Fthose affected.
